Two variants have no patched release:

- **u24r72f21m50t211:** the official release `u24r72f21m50t211-20261028_090706`
  is the fixed release, with the same main component versions as
  `u24r72f21m50t211-20260929_104918`.
- **u24r64f21m43t28:** its only release, pre-release
  `u24r64f21m43t28-20251128_145346`, is end of life.

The image `laifs-lumi-multi-20250728_103251.sif` on LUMI, from before
lumi-multitorch, is also affected and end of life.

